<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-17016] Rest api get call </title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-17016</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;It seems that the call to CacheStore load method from REST API (get command) is broken from v2.12 onwards. I&apos;ve attached a simple test program, and calling&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://localhost:8080/ignite?cacheName=RestApiTest&amp;amp;cmd=get&amp;amp;key=6&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;http://127.0.0.1:8080/ignite?cacheName=RestApiTest&amp;amp;cmd=get&amp;amp;key=6&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;dosen&apos;t seems to call the load method at all.&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
